# Pure domain logic

Isolate transforms in `packages/react/.../util/` (isomorphic pieces in `@repo/shared`).

## What belongs in util

| Kind | Example | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Types | `util/types.ts` | Domain shapes + `Action` union |
| Action creator | `util/rename-file.ts` | Returns `{ type, payload } as const` |
| Structural update | `update-array-at.ts` | Generic, tiny |
| Domain mutation | `reconcile-sort-order.ts` | Pure list rewrite |
| Build / seed | `initialize-files.ts` | No React |
| Derive view model | `map-space-file-rows.ts` | Hook calls this in render |
| Facade compose | `get-merged-space-files-with-uploads.ts` | Calls other utils only |
| Read helper | `get-share-viewer-url.ts` | Pure projection for UI |
| Event util | `call-all.ts` | Generic function combiner |

## Compose pure helpers

```ts
export function initializeFiles({ spaceId }: { spaceId: string }): SpaceFile[] {
  const seed = createFileSeed({ spaceId });
  return mapSpaceFileRows({ files: seed });
}
```

Thin facades compose smaller utils.

## Small pure util

Named export + options object (`function-args.mdc`):

```ts
export function updateArrayAt<T>(options: {
  array: T[];
  indexToReplace: number;
  newItem: T;
}): T[] {
  const { array, indexToReplace, newItem } = options;
  return [
    ...array.slice(0, indexToReplace),
    newItem,
    ...array.slice(indexToReplace + 1),
  ];
}
```

## Orchestrator calls util

Reducer:

```ts
case 'reorder': {
  const { fileId, nextSortOrder } = action.payload;
  return reconcileSortOrder({ files, fileId, nextSortOrder });
}
```

Related pure helpers share a file when they form one cohesive API.

## Pure projection for UI

Leaves call a util for derived display fields:

```ts
export function getFileRowMeta({
  file,
  uploads,
}: {
  file: SpaceFile;
  uploads: Upload[];
}) {
  const upload = uploads.find((item) => item.fileId === file.id);
  const status = upload?.status ?? file.status;
  return { status, isReady: status === 'ready' } as const;
}
```

## Guidelines

- `ui/` receives precomputed props or calls small util projections.
- `util/` stays React-free (no component imports).
- Prefer named exported functions; use `satisfies` / `as const` when shaping domain objects (`types-and-constants.mdc`).
